{"id":"junto","lemma":"junto","pos":"prep","rank":242,"glosses":["next to, together with, alongside","along with, together with, alongside","in conjunction with"],"ipa":"/ˈxunto/","order":555,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/ee/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-junto.wav","examples":[{"text":"Llegó junto conmigo.","en":"He arrived with me.","words":[{"g":"to arrive, get","l":"llegar"},null,{"g":"with me"}]},{"text":"Siéntate junto a mí.","en":"Sit beside me.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/501141","words":[{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"me"}]},{"text":"Su casa está junto a un río.","en":"His house is by a river.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459201","words":[{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"house"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"river"}]}]}